# Example "eedata" file
# Lines beginning "#" are comments
# nTx - No. threads per process in X
# nTy - No. threads per process in Y
#
# Correction: added useCubedSphereExchange=.TRUE., missing
# from the version carried over unchanged from Steph's flat lat-lon
# eedata. Confirmed against the official ECCOv4r6 release's own eedata,
# which sets it -- LLC90's facet topology has rotated/cross-facet tile
# connections a simple rectangular-neighbor exchange can't handle.
 &EEPARMS
 useCubedSphereExchange=.TRUE.,
 nTx=1,nTy=1
 /
# Note: Some systems use & as the
# namelist terminator. Other systems
# use a / character (as shown here).
